# Bookmark Manager — Cursor mirror

Full rules: `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md`. Obey these invariants in every session.

## Product
- Private read-later; owner-only by default.
- `CollectionShare` = read-only access to a collection and its bookmarks.
- Non-members: **404** on get-by-id (never 403 for unknown resources).
- Mutations and share management: **owner only**.
- Collection delete: null `bookmarks.collectionId`; cascade-delete shares.

## Stack
- Monorepo: `apps/api` (NestJS, Prisma, Postgres), `apps/web` (React, Vite, MUI, Tailwind), `packages/ui`, `packages/api-client`.
- No Next.js. Web port **3000**.
- Auth: Authorization Code + PKCE. API Bearer = Auth0 **access token** (audience `https://bbl-candidate-test-api`). JWKS **RS256** only; reject HS256/none; strict iss/aud/exp.
- Contract: Swagger → OpenAPI → Orval → `packages/api-client`. No hand-copied DTOs in web; no Prisma types in web.

## Engineering
- TDD for features and security claims; strict TypeScript; no `any`; SRP; DRY.
- Domain folders: api `src/domains/<domain>/{interface,application,infrastructure,domain,constants}` + `src/shared` (constants = TypeScript `enum` in `*.constant.ts`, same naming as web); web `src/pages/<route>/` + `src/domains/<domain>/{components,hooks,interfaces,constants,services,utils?}` + `src/config/` + `app` + `lib` (domains never contain `pages/`; UI copy stays inline).
- Fix ESLint before done; no blanket `eslint-disable`.
- Public docs: no employer/bank brand names.

## Privacy audit
Use `/.agent/commands/privacy-review.md` (`/privacy-review`) on diffs before claiming security-sensitive work is done.

## When stuck
Record decisions in `DECISIONS.md`; do not accept defaults that weaken privacy.
